  "title": "Now Available: DigitalOcean Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM)",
  "summary": "To help teams operate reliably in production with clear visibility into potential security issues, today we’re launching DigitalOcean Cloud Security Posture Management (CSPM). CSPM provides agentless, in-dashboard visibility into your infrastructure, helping you detect risks, prioritize what matters most, and fix issues fast with guided instructions—all without third-party tools or dedicated security teams.",
